    {"label":"Auger Torque and Depth Gauge","type":"TOOLS","evidence":"B","description":"Install torque limiters and depth markers on post hole digger masts to provide objective measurement of drilling resistance and achieved hole depth. Quantified depth and torque data ensure consistent post-setting depth across fence lines.","cite":"Applied Engineering in Agriculture, Vol. 33(4), 2017 – Fence Post Equipment","target":"Depth and torque measurement -> consistent hole specs -> uniform fence quality"}
