    {"label":"Conveyor Belt Splicing Kit","type":"TOOLS","evidence":"A","description":"Maintain on-site belt splicing equipment and trained personnel for emergency belt repair capability. Field splicing capability restores conveyor operation in hours rather than the days required to order and install replacement belts.","cite":"CEMA Belt Book – Splicing Methods; Flexco Splicing Equipment Documentation","target":"On-site splicing -> hours vs. days recovery -> minimized flow interruption"}
