    {"label":"Onboard Payload Scale System","type":"TOOLS","evidence":"A","description":"Install payload weighing systems that provide per-bucket load weights displayed in the cab. Onboard scales enable precise truck loading to legal weight limits, accurate material tracking, and elimination of trips to stationary scales.","cite":"SAE J742; Trimble/Loadrite Payload Management Documentation","target":"Payload scales -> precise truck loading -> eliminated overweight penalties"}
